<item ident="gc7250c554bed546fc81e1b603549e474" title="Pergunta">
<itemmetadata>
<qtimetadata>
<qtimetadatafield>
<fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel>
<fieldentry>multiple_choice_question</fieldentry>
</qtimetadatafield>
<qtimetadatafield>
<fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel>
<fieldentry>1.0</fieldentry>
</qtimetadatafield>
<qtimetadatafield>
<fieldlabel>original_answer_ids</fieldlabel>
<fieldentry>2067,4916,5947</fieldentry>
</qtimetadatafield>
</qtimetadata>
</itemmetadata>
<presentation>
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Esta é a primeira disciplina/curso do Certificado de Fundamentos Comerciais. Abaixo estão listadas as disciplinas/cursos deste certificado. A legenda a seguir ajudará você a entender os requisitos mínimos de tecnologia para essas disciplinas/cursos. Para mais informações sobre os requisitos de tecnologia, acesse: &lt;a class="inline_disabled" href="https://www.byupathway.edu/pt/requisitos-de-tecnologia" target="_blank"&gt;Requisitos de Tecnologia do BYU-Pathway&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border="1" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-color: #FFFFFF;"&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 33.2938%; text-align: center;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Smartphone" height="247" loading="lazy" src="$IMS-CC-FILEBASE$/assessment_questions/smartphone-icon-purple.svg?canvas_download=1" width="247"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dispositivo móvel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;É necessário um smartphone com sistema operacional Android 9+ ou iOS 14+.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 33.2938%; text-align: center;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Computação leve" loading="lazy" src="$IMS-CC-FILEBASE$/assessment_questions/light-computer-icon-blue.svg?canvas_download=1"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Computação leve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;É necessário um notebook com capacidade de executar aplicativos do Microsoft Office, como o Word e o Excel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 33.2938%; text-align: center;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Computação pesada" loading="lazy" src="$IMS-CC-FILEBASE$/assessment_questions/heavy-computer-icon-purple.svg?canvas_download=1"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Computação pesada&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;É necessário um notebook com capacidade de executar aplicativos mais exigentes.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Disciplinas/cursos para o &lt;strong&gt;Certificado de Fundamentos Comerciais&lt;/strong&gt; e seus requisitos de tecnologia&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border="1" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;"&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 49.9408%; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disciplina/curso&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 49.9408%; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisito de tecnologia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 49.9408%;"&gt;BUS 105 - Spreadsheet Essentials&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 49.9408%;"&gt;&lt;img alt="Computação leve" height="87" loading="lazy" src="$IMS-CC-FILEBASE$/assessment_questions/light-computer-icon-blue.svg?canvas_download=1" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" width="87"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 49.9408%;"&gt;COMM 150 - Interpersonal Theory and Practice&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 49.9408%;"&gt;&lt;img alt="Computação leve" height="87" loading="lazy" src="$IMS-CC-FILEBASE$/assessment_questions/light-computer-icon-blue.svg?canvas_download=1" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" width="87"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 49.9408%;"&gt;MKT 120 - Marketing Foundations&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 49.9408%;"&gt;&lt;img alt="Computação leve" height="87" loading="lazy" src="$IMS-CC-FILEBASE$/assessment_questions/light-computer-icon-blue.svg?canvas_download=1" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" width="87"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 49.9408%;"&gt;BUS 180 - Introduction to Financial Managment&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 49.9408%;"&gt;&lt;img alt="Computação leve" height="87" loading="lazy" src="$IMS-CC-FILEBASE$/assessment_questions/light-computer-icon-blue.svg?canvas_download=1" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" width="87"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qual é o requisito de tecnologia para as disciplinas/cursos deste certificado? Escolha a resposta correta abaixo.&lt;br/&gt;(Caso tenha outras dúvidas, entre em contato com seu(sua) instrutor(a).)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
</material>
<response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single">
<render_choice>
<response_label ident="2067">
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/plain">Todas as disciplinas/cursos exigem um smartphone com sistema operacional Android 9+ ou iOS 14+.</mattext>
</material>
</response_label>
<response_label ident="4916">
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/plain">Todas as disciplinas/cursos exigem um notebook com capacidade de executar aplicativos do Microsoft Office, como o Word e o Excel.</mattext>
</material>
</response_label>
<response_label ident="5947">
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/plain">Todas as disciplinas/cursos exigem um notebook com capacidade de executar aplicativos mais exigentes.</mattext>
</material>
</response_label>
</render_choice>
</response_lid>
</presentation>
<resprocessing>
<outcomes>
<decvar maxvalue="100" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal"/>
</outcomes>
<respcondition continue="No">
<conditionvar>
<varequal respident="response1">4916</varequal>
</conditionvar>
<setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">100</setvar>
</respcondition>
</resprocessing>
</item>
